{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">環西班牙單車賽，馬菲比蘭贏出第16站。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二日休息日結束後，今站車手角逐起伏的丘陵分站，全長181.1公里，主車群大部分時間掌控節奏。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCING.SPAIN-0600.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026uzCFzTI1981788911232.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCING.SPAIN-0600.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在總成績領先，紅衫的馬斯跟隨大集團返終點，繼續坐穩榜首。進入較窄路段時，有車手意外倒地，對其他車手影響不大。原本領先的五人集團，尾段被主車群追上。黃衫的馬菲比蘭，最後衝刺階段留守第二。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCING.SPAIN-0600_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026HEUkGvsMhf1788911298.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCING.SPAIN-0600_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這位英國21歲車手踩出3小時56分33秒，率先過終點，贏得他今屆第四個分站冠軍。西班牙的馬斯，在總成績有超過2分鐘優勢。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCING.SPAIN-0600_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026apfi76XviJ1788911301.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCING.SPAIN-0600_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T00:46:22.359144+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}